window.CARDS=window.CARDS||{};CARDS["people-kaneda-satoru"]=[{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v3-p124-1","v":"y1v3","y":1,"o":3,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami ryuuen-kakeru kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 3 sec  3 3  the class c boy who offers to help at class b s camp he interrupts ichinose in a reserved voice while horikita and ayanokoji are still there   pardon me  ichinose san  i m sorry to interrupt  do you know where nakanishi kun is   i thought i d offer to help  is that unnecessary   okay  thank you very much  a class c student estranged from his class for resisting ryuen and sheltered by class b  horikita notices that he speaks to ichinose with unusual formality  asks her for work  and she sends him to follow chihiro chan s group  the dispute with ryuen that got him out of class c  the pages say he claimed he would get by on his own  he has not told anyone his situation yet  and ichinose says she has not asked him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v3-p124-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3 sec. 3.3: the Class C boy who offers to help<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V3 · p.124<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At Class B&#x27;s camp he interrupts Ichinose in a reserved voice while Horikita and Ayanokōji are still there.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Pardon me, Ichinose-san? I’m sorry to interrupt. Do you know where Nakanishi-kun is?”<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I thought I’d offer to help. Is that unnecessary?”<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Okay. Thank you very much!”<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> A Class C student estranged from his class for resisting Ryūen and sheltered by Class B; Horikita notices that he speaks to Ichinose with unusual formality.<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Asks her for work, and she sends him to follow Chihiro-chan&#x27;s group.<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> The dispute with Ryūen that got him out of Class C; the pages say he claimed he would get by on his own.<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> He has not told anyone his situation yet, and Ichinose says she has not asked him.<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v3-p255-1\">→ After: Ch.7: the spy Ryuuen sent<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v3-p255-1","v":"y1v3","y":1,"o":3,"k":"","w":"ryuuen-kakeru kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 7  the spy ryuuen sent named in the lounge retelling as the spy ryuuen planted in class b  which dissolves the coincidence that put ibuki in class d s hands  ibuki was picked up by class d  but not by chance   the near coincidence of two people saved by two separate classes dissolved once kaneda in class b came out as a spy ryuuen had sent  the same kaneda satoru who offered to help at the shore earlier in the volume  the page now names him as the spy  the class c student who sent him into class b as a spy  the test in one line  class a failed on its internal rift  class b ran defense only and paid for believing kaneda  class c sent spies and negotiated with a  and class d avoided damage because he had been appointed the leader","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v3-p255-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7: the spy Ryuuen sent<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V3 · p.255–257<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the lounge retelling as the spy Ryuuen planted in Class B, which dissolves the coincidence that put Ibuki in Class D’s hands.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Fact<\/span> Ibuki was picked up by Class D, but not by chance — the near-coincidence of two people saved by two separate classes dissolved once Kaneda in Class B came out as a spy Ryuuen had sent.<span class=\"pg\">p.255<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The same Kaneda Satoru who offered to help at the shore earlier in the volume; the page now names him as the spy.<span class=\"pg\">p.255<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> The Class C student who sent him into Class B as a spy.<span class=\"pg\">p.255<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Fact<\/span> The test in one line: Class A failed on its internal rift, Class B ran defense-only and paid for believing Kaneda, Class C sent spies and negotiated with A, and Class D avoided damage because he had been appointed the leader.<span class=\"pg\">p.257<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v3-p124-1\">← Before: Ch.3 sec. 3.3: the Class C boy who offers to help<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v6-p68-1","v":"y1v6","y":1,"o":7,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru horikita-suzune manabe-shiho yukimura-teruhiko ayanokouji-kiyotaka ishizaki-daichi kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 4  bespectacled analyst bespectacled boy with a mushroom cut  first speaks as the x audio logic is laid out   so  by letting you get that far  this person turned the audio file into incriminating material   this x person s thought process is so cruel  i mean  he just let his friend get hurt   wouldn t x have thought to submit the audio file to the school  ryuuen compliments his cleverness  then his naivete reading is corrected   x s naivete accidentally saved us  or perhaps he isn t taking full advantage of his assets  if horikita shi had finished transferring private points over to ryuuen shi  then x would ve been defeated  horikita shi honorific in his analysis  present for the spy debrief  quiet until he names the photo witnesses   so  that means it s either yukimura shi or ayanokouji shi  right  names him as one of two photo options  pushes ayanokouji shi as more suspicious  always with horikita shi  hid athletic ability  ryuuen agrees on suspicion   can we really say that for sure  though  ayanokouji shi is always with horikita shi  isn t he  moreover  ayanokouji shi hid his athletic abilities until the sports festival  i think he s the more suspicious of the two   but  ryuuen shi  shouldn t we be especially suspicious of ayanokouji shi  debates him on yukimura vs ayanokouji vs hirata as mastermind material","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v6-p68-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: bespectacled analyst<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V6 · p.68, 72–74<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Bespectacled boy with a mushroom cut; first speaks as the X-audio logic is laid out.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"manabe-shiho.html\">Manabe Shiho<\/a> · <a href=\"yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“So, by letting you get that far, this person turned the audio file into incriminating material?”<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“This X person’s thought process is so cruel. I mean, he just let his friend get hurt.”<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Wouldn’t X have thought to submit the audio file to the school?”<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>10 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Ryuuen compliments his cleverness; then his naivete reading is corrected.<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “X’s naivete accidentally saved us. Or perhaps he isn’t taking full advantage of his assets. If Horikita-shi had finished transferring private points over to Ryuuen-shi, then X would’ve been defeated,”<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Horikita-shi honorific in his analysis.<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Manabe Shiho<\/b> Present for the spy debrief; quiet until he names the photo witnesses.<span class=\"pg\">p.72–73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “So, that means it’s either Yukimura-shi or Ayanokouji-shi, right?”<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Names him as one of two photo options.<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Pushes Ayanokouji-shi as more suspicious (always with Horikita-shi; hid athletic ability); Ryuuen agrees on suspicion.<span class=\"pg\">p.73–74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Can we really say that for sure, though? Ayanokouji-shi is always with Horikita-shi, isn’t he? Moreover, Ayanokouji-shi hid his athletic abilities until the sports festival. I think he’s the more suspicious of the two,”<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “But, Ryuuen-shi, shouldn’t we be especially suspicious of Ayanokouji-shi?”<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Debates him on Yukimura vs Ayanokouji vs Hirata as mastermind material.<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v6-p101-1\">→ After: Ch.5: predicted Class C question-writer<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v6-p101-1","v":"y1v6","y":1,"o":7,"k":"","w":"yukimura-teruhiko hasebe-haruka horikita-suzune kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 5  predicted class c question writer named by yukimura as the class c student most likely to write the final exam questions  best student in class c  the creepy weirdo with glasses in hasebe s read  hasebe s glasses line  yukimura does not put it that way but agrees  dorm call  horikita wants to know whether kaneda kun will really be the question maker  no dialogue from kaneda on these pages  named by yukimura as the class c student most likely to write the final exam questions  best student in class c  the creepy weirdo with glasses in hasebe s read  hasebe s glasses line  yukimura does not put it that way but agrees  dorm call  horikita wants to know whether kaneda kun will really be the question maker  no dialogue from kaneda on these pages","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v6-p101-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5: predicted Class C question-writer<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V6 · p.101, 103<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named by Yukimura as the Class C student most likely to write the final-exam questions. Named by Yukimura as the Class C student most likely to write the final-exam questions.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a> · <a href=\"hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a> · <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Best student in Class C; the creepy weirdo with glasses in Hasebe’s read.<span class=\"pg\">p.101<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Hasebe’s glasses line; Yukimura does not put it that way but agrees.<span class=\"pg\">p.101<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Dorm call: Horikita wants to know whether Kaneda-kun will really be the question-maker.<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> No dialogue from Kaneda on these pages.<span class=\"pg\">p.101, 103<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Best student in Class C; the creepy weirdo with glasses in Hasebe’s read.<span class=\"pg\">p.101<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Hasebe’s glasses line; Yukimura does not put it that way but agrees.<span class=\"pg\">p.101<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Dorm call: Horikita wants to know whether Kaneda-kun will really be the question-maker.<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> No dialogue from Kaneda on these pages.<span class=\"pg\">p.101, 103<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v6-p68-1\">← Before: Ch.4: bespectacled analyst<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v6-p184-1\">→ After: Ch.7: the likely question author<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v6-p184-1","v":"y1v6","y":1,"o":7,"k":"inner","w":"ryuuen-kakeru kushida-kikyou kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 7  the likely question author named as the probable author of kushida s switched envelope   excellently constructed problems  since ryuuen was involved  chances were high that kaneda made them  easy questions would have looked like sabotage  so hard ones hid the swap  implied author under ryuuen s direction  wrote the problems she submitted under ryuuen s plan  horikita says kaneda s questions were by no means easy  keisei might not have topped ninety either","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v6-p184-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7: the likely question author<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V6 · p.184, 194<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named as the probable author of Kushida’s switched envelope — excellently constructed problems.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q inner\">Since Ryuuen was involved, chances were high that Kaneda made them; easy questions would have looked like sabotage, so hard ones hid the swap.<span class=\"pg\">p.184<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Implied author under Ryuuen’s direction.<span class=\"pg\">p.184<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> Wrote the problems she submitted under Ryuuen’s plan.<span class=\"pg\">p.184<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Horikita says Kaneda’s questions were by no means easy; Keisei might not have topped ninety either.<span class=\"pg\">p.194<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v6-p101-1\">← Before: Ch.5: predicted Class C question-writer<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v7-p200-1","v":"y1v7","y":1,"o":8,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru shiina-hiyori ibuki-mio kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 7  named as a future class c leader named with hiyori as who will probably lead class c after ryuuen steps back   hiyori and kaneda will probably lead class c from here on out  as long as ayanokouji makes no move  it s still possible for you to rack up that many points  ryuuen s line to ibuki  kaneda is not present  the outgoing leader naming his successors  the other named successor  the listener who already read the 800 million plan","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v7-p200-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7: named as a future Class C leader<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7 · p.200<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named with Hiyori as who will probably lead Class C after Ryuuen steps back.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a> · <a href=\"ibuki-mio.html\">Ibuki Mio<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Hiyori and Kaneda will probably lead Class C from here on out. As long as Ayanokouji makes no move, it’s still possible for you to rack up that many points.”<span class=\"pg\">p.200<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ryuuen’s line to Ibuki; Kaneda is not present.<span class=\"pg\">p.200<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> The outgoing leader naming his successors.<span class=\"pg\">p.200<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> The other named successor.<span class=\"pg\">p.200<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ibuki Mio<\/b> The listener who already read the 800-million plan.<span class=\"pg\">p.200<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v7_5-p54-1","v":"y1v7.5","y":1,"o":9,"k":"","w":"ishizaki-daichi kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 3  named as the next strategist name hit only in ishizaki s answer about who will run class c strategy  passing mention   hell if i know  kaneda ll probably do it  i guess  ishizaki s pick to replace ryuuen s planning role","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v7_5-p54-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: named as the next strategist<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7.5 · p.54<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Name-hit only in Ishizaki’s answer about who will run Class C strategy.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention: “Hell if I know. Kaneda’ll probably do it, I guess.”<span class=\"pg\">p.54<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Ishizaki’s pick to replace Ryuuen’s planning role.<span class=\"pg\">p.54<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v7_5-p84-1\">→ After: Ch.4: named as future Class C leader<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v7_5-p84-1","v":"y1v7.5","y":1,"o":9,"k":"","w":"ryuuen-kakeru shiina-hiyori kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 4  named as future class c leader name hit in ayanokoji s worry about who will lead class c next semester  passing mention   next semester  kaneda and hiyori will probably lead class c no  class d  passing mention   that ll be up to kaneda and hiyori  said ryuuen   whether the class accepts the class a strike plan  ryuuen s pick to carry the strategic groundwork after stepping down  paired with her as the next leadership","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v7_5-p84-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: named as future Class C leader<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7.5 · p.84–85<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Name-hit in Ayanokōji’s worry about who will lead Class C next semester.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention: “Next semester, Kaneda and Hiyori will probably lead Class C…no, Class D.”<span class=\"pg\">p.84<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention: “That’ll be up to Kaneda and Hiyori,” said Ryuuen — whether the class accepts the Class A strike plan.<span class=\"pg\">p.85<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Ryuuen’s pick to carry the strategic groundwork after stepping down.<span class=\"pg\">p.84–85<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Paired with her as the next leadership.<span class=\"pg\">p.84–85<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v7_5-p54-1\">← Before: Ch.3: named as the next strategist<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v8-p11-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru shibata-sou kanzaki-ryuuji hirata-yousuke kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 2  the all four class siege present in the gym as class d s negotiating voice while ryuuen sits out the discussion   i ve determined that this is an opportunity we should seize   i say we try to overthrow class a here and now   this was my idea  his opinions are irrelevant  tells shibata that ryuuen s opinions are irrelevant and denies   then reframes   any backstage collaboration  grimaces after shibata s question about whether ryuuen ordered the strategy  partners with kanzaki on the b c d counter to class a s pitch  hirata likes the siege  kaneda accepts the hypothetical group process without resistance","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v8-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: the all-four-class siege<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.11–43<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Present in the gym as Class D’s negotiating voice while Ryuuen sits out the discussion.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"shibata-sou.html\">Shibata Sō<\/a> · <a href=\"kanzaki-ryuuji.html\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/a> · <a href=\"hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“I’ve determined that this is an opportunity we should seize.”<span class=\"pg\">p.40<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I say we try to overthrow Class A here and now”<span class=\"pg\">p.40<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“This was my idea. His opinions are irrelevant.”<span class=\"pg\">p.43<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Tells Shibata that Ryuuen’s opinions are irrelevant and denies — then reframes — any backstage collaboration.<span class=\"pg\">p.43<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shibata Sō<\/b> Grimaces after Shibata’s question about whether Ryuuen ordered the strategy.<span class=\"pg\">p.43<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Ryūji<\/b> Partners with Kanzaki on the B/C/D counter to Class A’s pitch.<span class=\"pg\">p.40–42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Hirata likes the siege; Kaneda accepts the hypothetical-group process without resistance.<span class=\"pg\">p.40, 43<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v8-p38-1\">→ After: Ch.2: passing mentions<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v8-p38-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"","w":"kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 2  passing mentions named across the group selection pages without individual rows beyond his cited scenes","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v8-p38-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: passing mentions<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.38–39, 49, 55<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named across the group-selection pages without individual rows beyond his cited scenes.<\/p><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v8-p11-1\">← Before: Ch.2: the all-four-class siege<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v8-p44-1\">→ After: Ch.2: Class D’s draft pick<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v8-p44-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"","w":"nagumo-miyabi gouda miyake-akito ryuuen-kakeru kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 2  class d s draft pick class d forms last  kaneda consults classmates and picks in the large group draft  declines nagumo s group   i would like to join second year gouda senpai s group  please    once again nagumo is passed over  chooses second year goda s mostly class a second years over nagumo s mixed bag  miyake s gloss  kaneda picked reliable strong allies  the  iffy  c d crowd in nagumo s group is what was avoided  leads the class d formation while ryuuen sits out   the class s slow  distrusted start is built around his absence  immediate selection once classmates are  consulted    a formality under his authority","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v8-p44-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: Class D’s draft pick<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.44–56<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Class D forms last; Kaneda consults classmates and picks in the large-group draft.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"index.html#gouda\">Gōda<\/a> · <a href=\"miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Declines Nagumo’s group: “I would like to join second-year Gouda-senpai’s group, please.” — once again Nagumo is passed over.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Gōda<\/b> Chooses second-year Gōda’s mostly-Class-A second-years over Nagumo’s mixed bag.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> Miyake’s gloss: Kaneda picked reliable strong allies; the “iffy” C/D crowd in Nagumo’s group is what was avoided.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Leads the Class D formation while Ryuuen sits out — the class’s slow, distrusted start is built around his absence.<span class=\"pg\">p.44–48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Immediate selection once classmates are “consulted” — a formality under his authority.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v8-p38-1\">← Before: Ch.2: passing mentions<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v8-p130-1\">→ After: Ch.4: dragged in and out<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v8-p130-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"spoken","w":"sudou-ken kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 4  dragged in and out named as class d s current size king  pulled into sudou s showdown and flees when it ends   if i don t  my vision is so bad that i can t see well enough to walk    on wearing glasses in the bath  dragged into the contest  loses instantly  exits with  finally  the game is over  on his face  no intention of joining  uncomfortable the whole time   one page only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v8-p130-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: dragged in and out<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.130<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named as Class D’s current size king; pulled into Sudou’s showdown and flees when it ends.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“If I don’t, my vision is so bad that I can’t see well enough to walk.” — on wearing glasses in the bath.<span class=\"pg\">p.130<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Dragged into the contest; loses instantly; exits with “Finally, the game is over” on his face.<span class=\"pg\">p.130<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> No intention of joining; uncomfortable the whole time — one page only.<span class=\"pg\">p.130<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v8-p44-1\">← Before: Ch.2: Class D’s draft pick<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v10-p316-1","v":"y1v10","y":1,"o":12,"k":"","w":"kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru epilogue  class poll result the bulletin board lists kaneda as the class d student with the most praise votes  27  received the most praise votes in class d in the class poll","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v10-p316-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Epilogue: Class Poll result<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V10 · p.316<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">The bulletin board lists Kaneda as the Class D student with the most praise votes (27).<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> Received the most praise votes in Class D in the Class Poll.<span class=\"pg\">p.316<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v11-p62-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"","w":"ichinose-honami sakayanagi-arisu ayanokouji-kiyotaka kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 3  choosing class b attends the commanders  meeting as class d s representative  wins the lottery draw for the right to choose an opponent  chooses class b as class d s opponent  explains that class d wants to take points from an upper class while avoiding class a  selects her class as class d s opponent  answers her question about the choice  faces him at the commanders  meeting","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y1v11-p62-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: Choosing Class B<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.62–66<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Attends the commanders’ meeting as Class D’s representative. Wins the lottery draw for the right to choose an opponent. Chooses Class B as Class D’s opponent. Explains that Class D wants to take points from an upper class while avoiding Class A.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Selects her class as Class D’s opponent.<span class=\"pg\">p.64–65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Answers her question about the choice.<span class=\"pg\">p.64–65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Faces him at the commanders’ meeting.<span class=\"pg\">p.62–66<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v2-p6-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v2-p6-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.6-354<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v3-p7-1","v":"y2v3","y":2,"o":18,"k":"","w":"kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v3-p7-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V3 · p.7-368<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v4_5-p10-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"","w":"kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v4_5-p10-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.10-290<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v5-p7-1","v":"y2v5","y":2,"o":21,"k":"","w":"kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v5-p7-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V5 · p.7-243<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v7-p7-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"","w":"kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v7-p7-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.7-207<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v8-p11-1","v":"y2v8","y":2,"o":24,"k":"","w":"kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v8-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V8 · p.11-208<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v9-p152-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"sakayanagi-arisu kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru kaneda  underestimated as a  puppet  sakayanagi names him and says she can t trust him for free  he smiles wryly  adjusts his glasses  and accepts that it is natural to suspect he is ryuen s puppet  then works for himself   it s perfectly natural to suspect you of being ryuuen s puppet  you have   i work for myself  and you work for yourself  that s the best relationship  canny and self possessed   he erases the message he shows hashimoto and keeps his own counsel  refusing to be anyone s agent  she suspects him of being ryuen s puppet  he works independently","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v9-p152-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kaneda: underestimated as a &quot;puppet&quot;<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.152<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sakayanagi names him and says she can&#x27;t trust him for free; he smiles wryly, adjusts his glasses, and accepts that it is natural to suspect he is Ryūen&#x27;s puppet, then works for himself.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It&#x27;s perfectly natural to suspect you of being Ryuuen&#x27;s puppet. You have...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.152<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I work for myself, and you work for yourself. That&#x27;s the best relationship.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.152<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Canny and self-possessed — he erases the message he shows Hashimoto and keeps his own counsel, refusing to be anyone&#x27;s agent.<span class=\"pg\">p.152<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> She suspects him of being Ryūen&#x27;s puppet; he works independently.<span class=\"pg\">p.152<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v10-p9-1","v":"y2v10","y":2,"o":28,"k":"","w":"kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v10-p9-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V10 · p.9-235<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v11-p11-1","v":"y2v11","y":2,"o":30,"k":"","w":"kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v11-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V11 · p.11-223<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v12-p12-1","v":"y2v12","y":2,"o":31,"k":"","w":"kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y2v12-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12 · p.12-228<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y3v2-p152-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"shiina-hiyori ryuuen-kakeru ishizaki-daichi hashimoto-masayoshi kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 5   depth read  kaneda s early arrival arrives 20 minutes early to the karaoke parlor  hoping to catch shiina alone   t thank you for coming today  shiina shi   i have regular meetings with ryuuen shi  so i would appreciate it if you didn t lump us together   no  i have not    reporting hashimoto has ignored his messages since the transfer nervous and reserved around shiina  sharp with ishizaki  objectively revises his evaluation of ayanokoji but rates him below ryuen sakayanagi  arrives early hoping to spend time with her  calls her  shiina shi  reports to him and has regular one on one meetings  is needled by him for arriving early to see shiina  notes he stopped replying after ayanokoji s transfer","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y3v2-p152-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5 — depth read: Kaneda&#x27;s early arrival<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.152–181<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Arrives 20 minutes early to the karaoke parlor, hoping to catch Shiina alone.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;T-Thank you for coming today, Shiina-shi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.175<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I have regular meetings with Ryuuen-shi, so I would appreciate it if you didn&#x27;t lump us together.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;No, I have not.&quot; — reporting Hashimoto has ignored his messages since the transfer<span class=\"pg\">p.177<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Nervous and reserved around Shiina, sharp with Ishizaki; objectively revises his evaluation of Ayanokōji but rates him below Ryūen/Sakayanagi.<span class=\"pg\">p.175–177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Arrives early hoping to spend time with her; calls her &quot;Shiina-shi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.175<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Reports to him and has regular one-on-one meetings.<span class=\"pg\">p.176–177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Is needled by him for arriving early to see Shiina.<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Notes he stopped replying after Ayanokōji&#x27;s transfer.<span class=\"pg\">p.177<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y3v2-p175-1\">→ After: Kaneda arrives early to meet Shiina; the Class B meeting<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y3v2-p175-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"shiina-hiyori ryuuen-kakeru ishizaki-daichi kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru kaneda arrives early to meet shiina  the class b meeting arrives at the karaoke parlor at 7 40 for an 8 p m  meeting  restless   having come early hoping shiina would too   t thank you for coming today  shiina shi   yes  it really is  i wonder what ryuuen shi is thinking   i don t know about tokitou shi  but i have regular meetings with ryuuenshi   yes  we haven t received any additional orders as of now   no  i have not  nervous and precise around shiina   adjusts his crooked glasses  burns the sight of her into memory  objectively revised his evaluation of ayanokoji several times but still rates him below ryuen sakayanagi  arrived early hoping to find her alone  calls her  shiina shi  has regular one on one meetings with him  reports hashimoto has stopped replying  is needled by him for arriving early to see shiina","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y3v2-p175-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kaneda arrives early to meet Shiina; the Class B meeting<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.175–178<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Arrives at the karaoke parlor at 7:40 for an 8 p.m. meeting, restless — having come early hoping Shiina would too.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;T-Thank you for coming today, Shiina-shi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.175<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Yes, it really is. I wonder what Ryuuen-shi is thinking.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.175<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I don&#x27;t know about Tokitou-shi, but I have regular meetings with Ryuuenshi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Yes. We haven&#x27;t received any additional orders as of now.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;No, I have not.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Nervous and precise around Shiina — adjusts his crooked glasses, burns the sight of her into memory; objectively revised his evaluation of Ayanokōji several times but still rates him below Ryūen/Sakayanagi.<span class=\"pg\">p.175–178<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Arrived early hoping to find her alone; calls her &quot;Shiina-shi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.175<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Has regular one-on-one meetings with him; reports Hashimoto has stopped replying.<span class=\"pg\">p.175–177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Is needled by him for arriving early to see Shiina.<span class=\"pg\">p.175–176<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y3v2-p152-1\">← Before: Ch.5 — depth read: Kaneda&#x27;s early arrival<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y3v2-p182-1\">→ After: Ch.6 — depth read: Kaneda&#x27;s envy and probe<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y3v2-p182-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiina-hiyori kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru ch 6   depth read  kaneda s envy and probe arrives at the library to visit hiyori  finds ayanokoji with her and joins their table   i m not very good at such meaningless small talk   it was the first time in a long while i d seen her genuine smile   you re the very picture of a hero  are you not  i envy you from the bottom of my heart   even that part of you is so cool it s infuriating  ayanokouji shi   then  what if that person were shiina shi  eloquent and passionate but self deprecating   heaps praise on ayanokoji while belittling himself  and envies him deeply  dislikes but is fascinated by him  envies him as a  hero  disparages himself  and probes what if hiyori hated him  leaves abruptly  is a frequent library visitor to see her  has feelings for her and was surprised by her genuine smile","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y3v2-p182-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 — depth read: Kaneda&#x27;s envy and probe<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.182–210<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Arrives at the library to visit Hiyori; finds Ayanokōji with her and joins their table.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I&#x27;m not very good at such meaningless small talk.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.196<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It was the first time in a long while I&#x27;d seen her genuine smile.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.197<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;You&#x27;re the very picture of a hero, are you not? I envy you from the bottom of my heart.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.198<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Even that part of you is so cool it&#x27;s infuriating, Ayanokouji-shi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.199<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Then, what if that person were Shiina-shi...?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.199<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Eloquent and passionate but self-deprecating — heaps praise on Ayanokōji while belittling himself, and envies him deeply; dislikes but is fascinated by him.<span class=\"pg\">p.196–199<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Envies him as a &quot;hero,&quot; disparages himself, and probes what if Hiyori hated him; leaves abruptly.<span class=\"pg\">p.196–200<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Is a frequent library visitor to see her; has feelings for her and was surprised by her genuine smile.<span class=\"pg\">p.195–200<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y3v2-p175-1\">← Before: Kaneda arrives early to meet Shiina; the Class B meeting<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y3v2-p196-1\">→ After: Kaneda&#x27;s envy in the library<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kaneda-satoru-y3v2-p196-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiina-hiyori kaneda-satoru","q":"kaneda satoru kaneda s envy in the library sits with ayanokoji in the library after hiyori is called away by the librarian   i m not very good at such meaningless small talk   with shiina shi you seem to be on good terms   when i saw you two from the entrance  i was frankly surprised  it was the first time in a long while i d seen her genuine smile   you re the very picture of a hero  are you not  i envy you from the bottom of my heart   that just makes you an anti hero  which is still a hero   even that part of you is so cool it s infuriating  ayanokouji shi   then  what if that person were shiina shi   it s quite all right  it makes no difference whether someone like me is here or not right now  eloquent and self deprecating   praises ayanokoji s looks  academics and physical ability while belittling himself  envies him deeply  and asks the cutting question of what would happen if shiina hated him  before leaving abruptly on supposed urgent business  holds a one sided conversation  envies him and leaves after testing him with hiyori s name  has feelings for her   notices her genuine smile and asks what if she hated ayanokoji  leaves so as not to intrude","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y3v2-p196-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kaneda&#x27;s envy in the library<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.196–200<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sits with Ayanokōji in the library after Hiyori is called away by the librarian.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I&#x27;m not very good at such meaningless small talk.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.196<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;With Shiina-shi—you seem to be on good terms.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.197<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;When I saw you two from the entrance, I was frankly surprised. It was the first time in a long while I&#x27;d seen her genuine smile.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.197<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You&#x27;re the very picture of a hero, are you not? I envy you from the bottom of my heart.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.198<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;That just makes you an anti-hero, which is still a hero.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.199<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Even that part of you is so cool it&#x27;s infuriating, Ayanokouji-shi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.199<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Then, what if that person were Shiina-shi...?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.199<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It&#x27;s quite all right. It makes no difference whether someone like me is here or not right now.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.200<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Eloquent and self-deprecating — praises Ayanokōji&#x27;s looks, academics and physical ability while belittling himself, envies him deeply, and asks the cutting question of what would happen if Shiina hated him, before leaving abruptly on supposed urgent business.<span class=\"pg\">p.196–200<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Holds a one-sided conversation; envies him and leaves after testing him with Hiyori&#x27;s name.<span class=\"pg\">p.196–200<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Has feelings for her — notices her genuine smile and asks what if she hated Ayanokōji; leaves so as not to intrude.<span class=\"pg\">p.197–200<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kaneda-satoru-y3v2-p182-1\">← Before: Ch.6 — depth read: Kaneda&#x27;s envy and probe<\/button><\/div><\/article>"}];
